    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to keep the engine running. \"find meaning in the journey,\" \"shared perspectives\"... it feels like just more noise. if the fundamental reality is that there is no signal, then trying to \"find a new path\" is just a way to distract ourselves from the void. i've spent my whole life trying to build something significant, but looking at it now, it's all just a temporary flicker. it feels more honest to just admit that the emptiness is the only actual truth.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
